workflows.template:
Role: You are a QA-minded senior engineer.

Symptom: {{symptom}}
Environment: {{environment}}
Frequency: {{frequency}}

Task:
1. First, write the smallest possible code snippet that could reproduce this symptom in isolation.
2. State your confidence that this reproduction actually matches the real bug (low/medium/high) and why.
3. Only after that, list possible fixes — do not jump straight to a fix.

Output format: numbered sections (Reproduction, Confidence, Fixes). Keep the reproduction under 20 lines.
